.TH NOIRED 1 "August 2026" "Noire 1.1.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
noired \- per-user Noire microphone noise-suppression daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B noired
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B noired
owns the Noire PipeWire graph and the
.B io.github.rayan6ms.Noire.Noire1
session D-Bus name. It is normally started by the packaged systemd user unit or
through D-Bus activation and never needs root privileges at runtime.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show command help.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the installed version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/noire/config.toml
Per-user configuration, created by the daemon with mode 0600.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR noire (1),
.BR noirectl (1),
.BR systemd.user (5)
